# Derelor's "black" is a word of its text (CR 612.1): Sleight of Mind changes it to blue, and then blue spells Bot1 casts
# cost {B} more and black ones do not. The {B} of the increase is a mana symbol, not a color word, so it stays {B}.
# Turn 1: Sleight of Mind (blue) costs only its {U} before the change; then Dark Ritual costs only its {B}, leaving
# {B}{B}{B}. Turn 3: blue Ancestral Recall costs {U}{B}, leaving one {B} of {U}{B}{B}.

